# LinuxServer.io images – use lscr.io registry

When using images from [LinuxServer.io](https://www.linuxserver.io/), pull from their primary registry **lscr.io**:

```yaml
# ✅ Use lscr.io
image: lscr.io/linuxserver/IMAGE:TAG

# ❌ Avoid docker.io or ghcr.io for LinuxServer images
# image: linuxserver/IMAGE:TAG
# image: ghcr.io/linuxserver/IMAGE:TAG
```

Example: `lscr.io/linuxserver/plex:latest`, `lscr.io/linuxserver/nextcloud:latest`.

Apply this when adding or editing services that use LinuxServer images.
